# Paths no linter checks, in .gitignore syntax. fd (lint-shell, lint-json,
# lint-toml, format), yamllint, ruff, rumdl, typos and deptry read this file.
# Mirror every change in:
# - the global `exclude` of .pre-commit-config.yaml (prek cannot read it);
# - with rumdl selected, the `exclude` of .rumdl.toml for file entries (rumdl
#   applies .ignore to directories only).

